Original TV-Fansub: LIME-Anime
_        Additional Work: ReDone-Subs

01:40.370 --> 01:42.830
On chime: "Summer"

01:45.870 --> 01:48.830
I wished I could finish this faster.

01:48.830 --> 01:51.040
Summer is going to end.

01:51.880 --> 01:53.460
My name is Asami.

01:53.460 --> 01:55.920
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

01:55.920 --> 01:59.550
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

02:00.010 --> 02:01.890
I'm actually married.

02:05.480 --> 02:07.600
Ahh, thank you very much.

02:08.390 --> 02:12.110
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei.
teaches at my school.

02:12.110 --> 02:15.230
Hold together, just a bit further.

02:15.230 --> 02:16.320
Okay!

02:16.320 --> 02:19.360
You see, over here...

02:18.820 --> 02:21.820
My husband is always at his most mature

02:21.820 --> 02:25.200
when he's helping me study.

02:25.660 --> 02:27.830
Asami, Asami!

02:28.410 --> 02:29.960
Ahh, yes?!

02:29.960 --> 02:32.000
Did you take all that in?

02:32.000 --> 02:34.460
Eh? Ummm...

02:36.460 --> 02:38.840
L-Let's take a little break.

02:39.930 --> 02:40.840
Hey!

02:49.480 --> 02:53.110
Why does studying put me to sleep?

03:00.280 --> 03:05.160
Aftermath of Beating the Heat

03:20.010 --> 03:22.930
My, my... how defenseless.

03:24.640 --> 03:29.980
Hey, you two! If you sleep like that, your stomachs will get cold.

03:32.650 --> 03:34.980
Oh, Sakura-san.

03:34.980 --> 03:36.610
What's up?

03:36.610 --> 03:41.610
If these hot days continue,
my body will turn to mush and never recover.

03:42.700 --> 03:44.370
Heat exhaustion?

03:44.370 --> 03:47.410
I was thinking of taking the day off.

03:47.950 --> 03:50.620
So, let's try and beat the heat tonight.

03:50.620 --> 03:52.420
Hot nabe:
it's fighting fire with fire.

03:52.420 --> 03:53.710
Nabe?

03:53.710 --> 03:55.420
Even though it's summer?

03:55.420 --> 03:58.500
Don't you know?
On hot days, eating hot stuff

03:58.500 --> 04:01.300
makes you sweat out the heat
and feel better, right?

04:01.300 --> 04:04.260
C'mon, let's do it! Whaddaya say?

04:06.140 --> 04:08.930
Sounds good, doesn't it, Asami?

04:09.770 --> 04:11.850
Yes.

04:14.190 --> 04:16.110
Cheers!

04:18.190 --> 04:20.570
All right, time to chow down!

04:20.570 --> 04:21.610
Heck yeah!

04:21.610 --> 04:22.900
Bon apetit!

04:26.200 --> 04:30.040
Delicious! You just have to have
nabe on a hot day!

04:31.040 --> 04:31.950
Yummy!

04:34.710 --> 04:37.670
Nabe <i>is</i> pretty good
in the summer, isn't it?

04:37.670 --> 04:40.250
Darling, your appetite is amazing.

04:40.250 --> 04:42.630
No, the food's just that good!

04:42.630 --> 04:44.130
Isn't it? Isn't it?

04:44.130 --> 04:45.220
Yes.

04:45.220 --> 04:48.300
Good work, Sasuke. Keep up the pace.

04:48.300 --> 04:49.810
Okay!

05:11.790 --> 05:16.080
Ahh, I couldn't eat another bite.

05:16.080 --> 05:21.250
Are you re-energized?
This calls for a nice cold shower, doesn't it?

05:21.250 --> 05:22.710
That was so tasty.

05:22.710 --> 05:25.010
I haven't eaten that much in a long time.

05:25.010 --> 05:26.180
Onee-chan!

05:27.090 --> 05:29.050
Let's get in the bath together.

05:30.550 --> 05:31.600
I give up, I give up!

05:31.600 --> 05:33.430
Why you little...

05:35.600 --> 05:36.980
From the club? Hello.

05:35.980 --> 05:36.980
"Gal Club Sakurako"

05:39.020 --> 05:43.530
Eh? Didn't I tell you
I was taking the day off?

05:44.150 --> 05:46.150
Well, sucks to be me.

05:46.570 --> 05:47.410
Sasuke!

05:47.990 --> 05:50.660
Time to go. The club is getting slammed.

05:50.660 --> 05:54.160
No way! I'm spending the night at Onee-chan's house.

05:53.700 --> 05:54.620
I don't think so!

05:54.620 --> 05:57.620
Don't bother the newlyweds.

05:57.620 --> 05:59.500
See you~!

06:03.840 --> 06:06.130
Darling, you can take your bath first.

06:08.510 --> 06:11.680
D-Darling, what's wrong?

06:12.050 --> 06:14.560
S-Stomach's... acting up...

06:14.560 --> 06:18.310
W-Wait just a minute. I know...

06:20.270 --> 06:22.150
We're out of drugs.

06:25.780 --> 06:27.820
That's it! An ambulance!

06:33.990 --> 06:37.250
He's been weak since this morning.

06:37.790 --> 06:41.250
It's likely caused by the shock stemming from overeating.

06:42.080 --> 06:45.670
Have him rest in one of the beds,
and observe his condition for a while.

06:46.090 --> 06:47.970
Okay.

06:50.220 --> 06:53.220
Ohh, what a relief it is.

06:53.890 --> 06:55.770
Huh? What?

06:56.680 --> 06:58.810
Ichimaru-sensei?

06:58.810 --> 06:59.770
Eh?

07:00.100 --> 07:01.520
What's wrong?

07:03.730 --> 07:06.530
I kind of upset my stomach.

07:06.530 --> 07:08.940
Did you eat something strange?

07:07.530 --> 07:09.610
Why is Kasumi here?

07:11.320 --> 07:14.450
This is bad. They'll find out.

07:19.370 --> 07:21.080
S-Satomi!?

07:21.500 --> 07:24.920
Asami! Why are you here?

07:24.920 --> 07:27.510
What're <i>you</i> doing here, Satomi?

07:27.510 --> 07:32.590
Kasumi suddenly felt ill at the karaoke box,
so I brought her here.

07:32.590 --> 07:34.680
She's resting in a room right now.

07:34.680 --> 07:36.850
Hey! Hey, hey, hey, hey!

07:37.350 --> 07:41.350
Ah. Hey, Kasumi! You okay already?

07:42.020 --> 07:44.810
Guess what: Ichimaru-sensei is here.

07:44.810 --> 07:46.440
Ichimaru-sensei?

07:46.440 --> 07:48.820
He got admitted with stomach pains.

07:48.820 --> 07:50.650
Did you hear that, Asami?

07:50.650 --> 07:51.780
Um, yeah.

07:51.780 --> 07:53.360
Eh? Asami?

07:54.660 --> 07:56.370
Why are you here?

07:56.370 --> 07:58.580
Ahh, no, you see...

07:59.580 --> 08:02.040
Don't tell me you're with Ichimaru-sensei.

08:02.040 --> 08:05.670
N-No, it's not like I'm
in a relationship with him.

08:05.670 --> 08:07.670
Suspiciously specific denial!

08:07.670 --> 08:09.170
But it's true!

08:09.170 --> 08:11.220
So why ARE you here, Asami?

08:11.220 --> 08:13.050
Are you feeling sick?

08:13.050 --> 08:14.720
W-Well...

08:14.720 --> 08:16.640
See, you can't say it.

08:16.640 --> 08:18.680
She's my escort.

08:19.430 --> 08:23.730
I suddenly had this pain in my stomach, so I had Asami come here with me.

08:23.730 --> 08:25.480
When did she...?

08:24.980 --> 08:26.730
The neighbor?

08:26.730 --> 08:27.770
Sakura-san.

08:28.440 --> 08:30.780
Mizunosaki Sakura-san, this way please.

08:30.280 --> 08:31.610
Coming!

08:31.610 --> 08:34.410
Asami, I'll be back in a bit.

08:37.070 --> 08:38.910
Sakura-san...

08:38.740 --> 08:42.160
"Reception"

08:39.450 --> 08:42.160
Sheesh, <i>that's</i> what it was?

08:42.160 --> 08:44.670
Why didn't you say so before?

08:46.040 --> 08:48.750
Hey, Asami, isn't this a great chance?

08:49.170 --> 08:53.170
You can win Ichimaru-sensei's heart by nursing him back to health.

08:53.170 --> 08:54.510
But I said...

08:54.510 --> 08:56.680
Don't let your chance slip away.

08:57.220 --> 08:58.640
Good luck!

09:14.450 --> 09:16.530
Darling...

09:16.910 --> 09:20.660
All I did was eat too much,
so I'm going to head on home.

09:20.660 --> 09:21.540
Okay.

09:22.750 --> 09:25.000
Thanks for the help back there.

09:25.870 --> 09:27.080
No problem.

09:27.500 --> 09:28.580
Bye.

09:35.090 --> 09:37.180
Say, Darling.

09:37.800 --> 09:41.760
Whenever I had a tummy-ache as a child...

09:41.760 --> 09:46.020
...my father always rubbed me like this,
until I got well.

09:51.070 --> 09:53.480
I'm sorry, Darling.

09:53.940 --> 09:57.530
I still have a long ways to go as a wife.

09:58.030 --> 10:01.450
I got all kinds of flustered.

10:02.410 --> 10:05.450
I couldn't do anything.

10:12.090 --> 10:14.460
Oh, Darling?!

10:16.380 --> 10:17.470
Morning.

10:18.090 --> 10:20.180
Darling, how's your stomach?

10:20.180 --> 10:23.470
It's fine. I guess I made you worry.

10:24.850 --> 10:26.270
Thank goodness.

10:26.890 --> 10:30.850
Thank you. You've been nursing me
all this time, haven't you?

10:40.780 --> 10:43.830
I heard about it from the neighbors.
You okay now?

10:43.830 --> 10:47.160
Y-Yeah, sorry to worry you.

10:47.160 --> 10:48.460
I see.

10:49.620 --> 10:53.540
You idiots!! A home invader could've just waltzed on in!

10:53.540 --> 10:56.710
Turn off the lights and
lock the doors when you go out!

10:57.130 --> 11:00.840
Aack, I completely forgot!

11:01.340 --> 11:02.850
Geez...

11:03.800 --> 11:06.890
Because of that,
I had to stay here until you got back.

11:06.890 --> 11:07.850
Eh?

11:08.430 --> 11:11.900
Father stayed up all night to watch the house.

11:11.900 --> 11:13.310
Huh?

11:15.520 --> 11:17.900
Hey, these stomach bands...

11:21.740 --> 11:24.870
Father! What're these...?

11:25.200 --> 11:28.080
Ah, you have to keep your stomach warm,

11:28.080 --> 11:30.370
so I brought them for you.

11:32.630 --> 11:33.790
Father...

12:03.700 --> 12:08.870
We've chosen the following people
to compete in next week's sports meet.

12:08.870 --> 12:11.370
For the girls' 200-meter: Hirataki-san.

12:11.370 --> 12:13.210
For the boys': Ishibashi-kun...

12:13.960 --> 12:15.420
My name is Asami.

12:15.420 --> 12:17.380
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

12:18.130 --> 12:21.550
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

12:21.550 --> 12:23.130
I'm actually married.

12:24.090 --> 12:28.220
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei, teaches at my school.

12:28.640 --> 12:32.430
Takahashi-kun's sure to get
a good time in the 100-meter, right?

12:32.430 --> 12:35.770
All the members of the boys'
relay team have been decided.

12:35.770 --> 12:40.940
Onohara-san, Horiguchi-san, Endou-san, we're counting on you for the final event.

12:40.940 --> 12:42.030
Eh? Me?

12:42.030 --> 12:43.950
Why us?

12:44.320 --> 12:48.030
Participation in the sports meet is mandatory for everyone.

12:48.030 --> 12:50.950
The only girls left are you three.
Good luck out there!

12:52.830 --> 12:56.790
Are you okay with this, Asami?
You're in it too.

12:56.790 --> 12:58.380
Eh? What?

12:58.960 --> 13:03.970
Girls' 1000-meter dash: Onohara, Horiguchi, Endou

12:59.380 --> 13:02.460
All right, let's present
a united front as a class,

13:02.460 --> 13:04.970
and do everything we can
to be the best in our year!

13:04.970 --> 13:06.510
Yeah!

13:06.510 --> 13:09.260
1-1000-meter...

13:09.300 --> 13:14.230
A Reward from My Husband

13:22.480 --> 13:26.030
What am I to do? I've got no confidence.

13:27.070 --> 13:28.780
I'm home!

13:28.780 --> 13:30.620
Welcome back.

13:38.790 --> 13:40.500
What's wrong?

13:41.670 --> 13:43.420
The 1000-meter race?

13:43.420 --> 13:46.630
Yes. I'm a total klutz
when it comes to sports...

13:46.630 --> 13:49.550
It's the last chance to score points
in the class rankings.

13:49.550 --> 13:52.930
If I don't get a good result,
I'm just going to let everybody down.

13:52.930 --> 13:54.140
Hmmm...

13:54.730 --> 13:58.400
If I recall,
the top three finishers get points.

13:58.400 --> 14:00.610
That's it! Asami,

14:00.610 --> 14:05.070
if you finish in the top three for the 1000-meter dash, I'll give you a reward.

14:05.070 --> 14:07.070
A reward?

14:07.740 --> 14:11.030
Yeah, and it'll be a good one.
How's that sound?

14:11.030 --> 14:12.790
Does that inspire you?

14:13.700 --> 14:16.040
A reward...?

14:31.140 --> 14:34.260
Asami, this is your reward.

14:34.810 --> 14:39.100
Ahh, Darling... at last.

14:40.600 --> 14:42.610
Darling~!

14:43.860 --> 14:45.070
Asami?

14:45.070 --> 14:47.400
Y-Yes, Darling?

14:47.740 --> 14:50.240
I'll give it my best shot.

14:52.740 --> 14:54.450
Morning.

14:55.580 --> 14:57.500
Good morning, Darling.

14:57.870 --> 15:00.620
I'm heading off to school first, 'kay?

15:00.620 --> 15:01.500
O... kay.

15:01.500 --> 15:05.500
Breakfast is on the table, and I'm out the door.

15:06.710 --> 15:08.920
Almost the crack of dawn...

15:13.850 --> 15:16.890
Okay, time for intensive training.

15:17.180 --> 15:19.850
Why've you started
practicing in the morning?

15:19.850 --> 15:24.610
Maybe "someone" promised her a reward for finishing in the top three.

15:25.190 --> 15:28.990
O-Of course not!
It's all about the class spirit.

15:28.990 --> 15:32.610
Don't you two also want to lead our class to victory?

15:33.490 --> 15:35.160
Well, it beats losing...

15:35.160 --> 15:36.490
Right?

15:36.950 --> 15:40.000
With that out of the way,
let's get our training underway.

15:48.260 --> 15:51.760
Ahh, I'm beat. I can't take any more.

15:52.630 --> 15:56.140
What's the matter?
You haven't even run 100 meters yet.

15:56.140 --> 15:57.970
I think I'm going to pass.

15:57.970 --> 16:00.600
My body won't hold up
if I run this hard in the morning.

16:00.600 --> 16:02.230
I'm tired too...

16:02.230 --> 16:03.440
You two...

16:03.440 --> 16:06.400
Fine, I'm going to train by myself.

16:08.730 --> 16:10.240
She's a real go-getter, isn't she?

16:10.240 --> 16:11.820
Sure is.

16:17.330 --> 16:22.290
It is said that black holes
can even absorb light.

16:24.250 --> 16:26.590
What's up with Asami?

16:43.270 --> 16:46.650
I see, you're working hard.

16:53.610 --> 16:55.950
Asami, the bath's open.

17:10.630 --> 17:14.130
"Do your best!"

17:29.150 --> 17:32.820
I <i>will</i> do my best, Darling...

17:36.740 --> 17:37.950
Ready.

17:39.240 --> 17:41.700
Asami's at it again today.

17:42.040 --> 17:43.870
Just like she has all week.

17:43.870 --> 17:47.080
Yeah, and after seeing that much effort...

17:47.080 --> 17:50.420
...we can't just sit back and watch anymore.

17:51.880 --> 17:54.550
Hey, Asami!!

17:54.880 --> 17:56.680
We're going to run with you.

17:56.680 --> 17:58.300
Kasumi, Satomi...

17:59.550 --> 18:01.350
Let's do our best together.

18:02.720 --> 18:03.680
Yeah!

19:15.340 --> 19:18.010
Tomorrow's the day of the sports meet.

19:18.010 --> 19:21.340
Yeah. We've done everything we could.

19:21.340 --> 19:25.010
Now it's time to run
the 1000-meter dash for real.

19:30.390 --> 19:31.730
Darling.

19:32.270 --> 19:35.900
I'll run as hard as I can in the 1000-meter.

19:35.900 --> 19:39.240
If I finish third or higher,
that reward's as good as mine, right?

19:39.240 --> 19:42.780
You got that right.
I'll be cheering for you.

19:44.410 --> 19:46.030
Good night.

19:54.920 --> 19:59.420
Attention please.
This year's sports meet has been canceled.

19:59.420 --> 20:01.680
Let's do our best again next year.

20:00.720 --> 20:02.590
You'll all catch colds.

20:05.300 --> 20:09.060
No... No way!!

20:14.650 --> 20:16.020
I tried so hard,

20:16.520 --> 20:19.940
and got so far, but in the end,
my reward got canceled,

20:19.940 --> 20:22.150
along with the sports meet.

20:24.740 --> 20:27.950
Darling, I...

20:28.870 --> 20:31.750
Asami, I'm going to
give you your reward.

20:32.330 --> 20:33.790
But, the sports meet-

20:34.210 --> 20:36.290
You did your very best.

20:36.290 --> 20:38.800
That's more than enough
to earn your reward.

20:40.630 --> 20:42.130
Darling.

20:43.130 --> 20:44.970
Okay, now close your eyes.

20:44.970 --> 20:45.840
Okay.

20:46.220 --> 20:50.100
F-Finally, my husband and I will...

20:50.520 --> 20:54.140
Asami, this is your reward.

20:55.520 --> 21:00.480
My legs are worn out from all that training.
So please, be gentle.

21:01.570 --> 21:02.940
Darling...

21:06.990 --> 21:08.990
Go ahead, open your eyes.

21:11.160 --> 21:13.250
An astronomy yearbook?

21:14.460 --> 21:17.000
And not just any astronomy yearbook!

21:17.000 --> 21:21.250
One of the rarest in the world,
with a print run limited to 50 copies.

21:21.250 --> 21:24.630
It's autographed by the famous astronomer,
Professor Isaac.

21:25.050 --> 21:27.340
I... see.

21:27.840 --> 21:30.760
I was positive you'd absolutely love this.

21:30.760 --> 21:34.890
It wasn't easy to find;
I had to search high and low.

21:34.890 --> 21:39.400
I checked dozens of book stores,
and I finally struck gold yesterday.

21:37.060 --> 21:38.520
Darling...

21:40.070 --> 21:42.230
I'm glad I managed to get it in time.

21:41.690 --> 21:43.110
Darling!

21:44.820 --> 21:47.070
Asami, are you okay?

21:47.070 --> 21:50.160
Darling, thank you so much.

21:50.910 --> 21:53.200
You put so much thought
into this reward...

